<title>UK: Allied Domecq sells distillery.</title>
<headline>Allied Domecq sells distillery.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food and drinks group Allied Domecq Plc said on Thursday it had sold its Ardbeg distillery, brand and maturing whisky stocks to Scottish distiller Glenmorangie Plc for 7 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
